  "worked_solution": "We know that $\\text{rank}(P)$ is the number of pivot columns in $P.$ \n\nSince $P$ has $8$ columns and $2$ of them are non-pivots, then the number of pivot columns in $P$ is \n\n$$\n8-2=6.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\text{rank}(P)=6.$",
